king":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-26T17:11:45","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"d5515972-1fc5-40f6-bb2f-193b0c813193","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621132614,"PostDateInt":1787735389000,"PostDate":"2026-08-26T17:09:49","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件开发专家-Hardware Development Expert(J20620)","OrgId":700593228,"Org":"SDE-DH","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","安徽省·合肥市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.硬件方案规划与导入： 主导硬件产品调研反馈与新技术导入，完成前期方案规划及JEDEC协议设计规范整理输出；\n2.硬件项目设计： 主导硬件项目设计，涵盖控制器、内存、电源等关键模块的方案制定与实现；\n3.调试与量产推进： 主导bring up回板调试，包括模组整体调试与平台适配，推动产品从试产到量产的全过程，确保项目schedule按节点交付；\n4.问题解决与质量优化： 主导issue解决，涵盖进度、资源、风险及质量维度，对生产过程中出现的质量问题进行整理、分析，并提出优化改进措施并推动闭环；\n5.供应链与成本优化： 主导低成本方案及供应链项目调研，推动成本优化；\n6.测试板规划与流程完善： 主导EVB测试板的规划与开发，完善设计流程规范。","Require":"1.教育背景与专业知识：硕士及以上学历，电子信息工程、通信工程或相关专业；\n2.专业技能与资格：精通symbol封装设计、器件选型、原理图设计及EDA工具，熟悉Layout设计规范（堆叠、板材、EQ等生产事项），了解信号完整性与电源完整性的分析逻辑，熟悉结构布局，精通硬件板卡原理设计及设计规范制定，熟悉常见的硬件测试方案（涵盖高速、低速、电源方面）；\n3.行业与专业经验：5年以上硬件开发经验，具备存储或内存模组类产品开发经验者优先；\n4.项目/任务成果：主导过至少2款硬件产品的完整开发流程，完成从方案规划到量产交付的全流程闭环；\n5.其他要求：具备逻辑思维能力，具有项目主导与资源协调能力，善于团队协作与沟通。","ClassificationOne":"研发技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-26T17:09:49","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"bc99606f-eab9-43ba-a8d6-7e345bd1144e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621132610,"PostDateInt":1787735230000,"PostDate":"2026-08-26T17:07:10","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"SI/PI设计专家-SI/PI Design Expert(J20621)","OrgId":700593228,"Org":"SDE-DH","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","安徽省·合肥市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.SI/PI分析与设计优化： 主导芯片与封装产品在芯片级、封装级、系统级的信号完整性与电源完整性分析、设计优化及仿真验证，输出完整SI/PI解决方案；\n2.高速链路方案设计与优化： 协同高速接口、芯片IO、封装等链路方案设计，完成阻抗控制、时序分析、串扰、电源噪声等关键问题的分析与优化；\n3.芯片信号建模与通路仿真： 主导芯片信号建模及整个通路的仿真，完成IO驱动能力、SSO以及高速信号有源和无源性能的建模仿真，保证SI性能满足要求；\n4.电源方案制定与仿真优化： 主导芯片电源方案的制定，通过对电源方案进行建模仿真，在时域噪声、频域阻抗、电源密度、IR-drop等方面优化，保证PI满足要求；\n5.测试验证与问题定位： 熟练使用示波器、网络分析仪等测试仪器，完成SI/PI相关测试与问题定位，支撑仿真与实测对标；\n6.流程建设与工具开发： 使用Matlab或Python实现仿真数据处理、流程自动化、结果批量分析等工作，参与SI/PI设计规范、仿真流程及测试方法的建设与优化，提升团队设计与交付效率。","Require":"1.教育背景与专业知识：硕士及以上学历，电子信息、微电子、通信工程、微波电磁场、物理或数学等相关专业；\n2.专业技能与资格：精通芯片级、封装级、系统级SI/PI原理与设计方法，熟悉DDR、PCIe等常见接口者优先，熟练使用至少两款主流SI/PI仿真工具（如HFSS、CST、Sigrity、PowerSI、ADS、Hspice等），具备脚本开发能力，能使用Matlab或Python进行数据处理与工具开发，熟练使用示波器、网络分析仪等仪器，具备SI/PI测试方案制定与问题定位能力；\n3.行业与专业经验：3年以上信号完整性或电源完整性工作经验，熟悉硬件系统，有存储产品开发经验者优先，熟悉PowerPC/x86/ARM等计算机体系结构，有硬件系统bringup和UEFI/Linux系统测试经验者优先；\n4.项目/任务成果：主导或深度参与过至少2款芯片或模组产品的SI/PI设计与验证项目，成功推动仿真到实测对标与量产交付；\n5.其他要求：工作严谨，具备较强的问题分析、定位及解决能力，能承受一定项目交付压力。","ClassificationOne":"研发技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-26T17:07:10","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"04acd2ae-1b4c-4695-b926-77bae9744872","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621132237,"PostDateInt"